== Usage ==
Using a '''Poignant Carrot Bait''' on {{zone|The Garden}} guarantees the next [[The Garden#Visitors|Visitor]] to spawn to be the {{NPCSprite|Carrot King Avatar}}. Doing so displays the following message:

{{Dialogue|&7&oThe Carrot King Avatar acknowledges your presence. You hear a hopping noise getting nearer...}}

Using a '''Poignant Carrot Bait''' immediately after attracting the {{NPCSprite|Carrot King Avatar}} will display the following message:
{{Dialogue|&cThe Carrot King Avatar is already on their way...}}
If they are already in the queue, it will instead display:
{{Dialogue|&cThe Carrot King Avatar does not take kindly to greed. Finish your active Carrot King Avatar commission first.}}

